-- Synthetic seed data for the legacy schema (works in the DB2 and Oracle dialects).
-- Fake applicants, generic case types. Edge cases on purpose:
--   CHAR padding on every text column; CLOSE_DT 0001-01-01 sentinel on every case that is not closed;
--   non-ASCII names (applicants 7 and 13); amounts with cents, 0.01 and the DECIMAL(11,2) maximum.
